const VOX7 = {"Mind the door. The wind takes it.":"v7_4faaf47a","Kell. Radio. Meridian has had one man on it for eleven days. That is a count, not a complaint.":"v7_ee05f29b","You came off a raft. I watched the light on it for an hour before it got here.":"v7_d0af8d25","The lamp. I saw it from the shack. I haven't seen that colour since I came.":"v7_0212c275","Here. The boat key. She's fuelled. I did that the first day, in case.":"v7_0d2de0e9","Or don't go. I've got the radio.":"v7_99f190ee","There's a lighthouse south. Cape Sorrel. Wren keeps it. She says it has been dark a year.":"v7_83830d9d","She says it wants three things. Fuel, a motor, and a cable. I don't know what she means by cable.":"v7_8d806cb8","The buoys run out to it. They're on the generator. Grey house, east side of the deck.":"v7_0fd2c387","There's a diver in Habitat Two. Fen. Seabed, north of us, nine metres down.":"v7_53f989ea","I can't raise him. I don't know if that's the radio or him.":"v7_1ac4762b","There are flares on the helipad. Take them.":"v7_9d1093e6","It won't stop it. It makes it think about it.":"v7_0c5e28d8","Don't swim in the open dark. If you have to, bring a light with you.":"v7_1b3a91e3","Go on, then. Or sit. The kettle's hot.":"v7_1f699211","I'll hold the radio. Somebody should.":"v7_0020a3cf","The wind's gone. I keep checking the window.":"v7_46349224","Keep to the buoys.":"v7_3a8e27f9","Is it raining out there? The window's salt, I can't tell.":"v7_936eac71","Wipe your feet. There is no floor under the mat, it is all rock.":"v7_65fc801f","Wren. Keeper. The lamp has been out since the Aurelia went onto the shoal.":"v7_c03ae863","Kell said you were coming. He never says that about anyone.":"v7_0578d6d5","There she goes.":"v7_70662852","Look at the water. It has gone down. It does, for a while.":"v7_32f8fe70","Tomas turned her every night for forty years. I turned her for eleven.":"v7_670df216","The log has two columns. One's mine. I'd like the other filled in.":"v7_7926ccd5","Fuel for the burner is in the Aurelia's engine room. The motor for the lens went down with the Halcyon.":"v7_09ec0f71","The lamp takes its power from the rig by a cable under the sea. It parted west of the rock, a few fathoms down.":"v7_876ade63","The clamp is on my table. Take it.":"v7_bb709f0e","You splice it by hand, down there. Do not let go halfway.":"v7_78e3df94","The tower door is on the north side. Ladder inside. Mind the third rung.":"v7_702e757e","Ships went onto that shoal for fifty years with the lamp lit.":"v7_9646cb29","I would like to know who it was lit for.":"v7_ed65dd02","There is tea. There is a second chair. I am not asking.":"v7_27f65a16","Tomas would have liked you. He liked anyone who got wet.":"v7_8b039327","The cable, the fuel, the motor. In any order. Tell me when you have them.":"v7_3904a7d2","Come up for air before you need it.":"v7_d9c6abb0","Don't swim out here after dark, if you can help it. I know.":"v7_ecd76d5f","Is someone there? The air has gone thin. I can't think. The line first, please.":"v7_76ceb590","Is that a person? Say something. I've been answering the cable.":"v7_b0d02e33","Fen. Diver. Nine days in a tin can, and the air only just came back. I could kiss the rig.":"v7_4b89f725","Sit on the bench. Not the green one. The green one has been talking.":"v7_d5bd1cf3","If it's something off the Halcyon, it'll be in her bridge safe. Her skipper and I used to talk on the radio.":"v7_f31f7ce4","He read me his combination once, as a joke. I kept the first number. Four.":"v7_28beac1b","The rest he gave to anyone who was listening.":"v7_bc488c6c","It doesn't bite, mostly. It arrives. Be somewhere with a light on when it does.":"v7_2b29c7fe","And don't take the lantern in the Halcyon. It isn't a lantern.":"v7_e835b807","The lamp! The whole water has gone gold. I can see it from here.":"v7_e64ea9c8","I think I'll stay down a bit. Somebody ought to keep the habitat warm.":"v7_749f0315","Take a flare. There's one on the rack.":"v7_91840651","Breathe out slowly on the way up. I say that to everyone.":"v7_2666aa0b","Tell Kell the coffee here is better than his.":"v7_a7d99fba","That's her running. Hear that? First noise on here I didn't make.":"v7_6de27149","Air house next. Northeast corner, red wheel. There's a man on that line.":"v7_4310f916","He'll be shouting for you by now. Down the north side and keep going. Don't be clever.":"v7_2790c28a","Sit. The pen is on the log. Second column.":"v7_abe8797a","The generator. Grey house, east side of the deck.":"v7_05fb8d14","The air house. Northeast corner of the deck, red wheel.":"v7_2f758c9e","Fen is in Habitat Two. North of the rig, nine metres down.":"v7_2921b073","Fuel is on the Aurelia, the ship on the shoal west of the rig. The can is on her deck, the tank is in her engine room.":"v7_1210ddcc","The motor is in the safe on the Halcyon's bridge. North-west of the rig, ten metres down.":"v7_85ad8e65","Wren has a clamp. The cape is south of the rig. Keep to the buoys.":"v7_a464b8d0","The cable is parted west of the cape, on the seabed.":"v7_bdbe8bdd","Take it all up the tower, to the lamp room.":"v7_a9b2db7e","Nine. The generator. Grey house, east side of the deck.":"v7_56f97503","Nine. The air house. Northeast corner of the deck, red wheel.":"v7_4f1f43cb","Nine. Fen is in Habitat Two. North of the rig, nine metres down.":"v7_5f72d457","Nine. Fuel is on the Aurelia, the ship on the shoal west of the rig. The can is on her deck, the tank is in her engine room.":"v7_3f3ca75e","Nine. The motor is in the safe on the Halcyon's bridge. North-west of the rig, ten metres down.":"v7_58730406","Nine. Wren has a clamp. The cape is south of the rig. Keep to the buoys.":"v7_0048f924","Nine. The cable is parted west of the cape, on the seabed.":"v7_efdd5085","Nine. Take it all up the tower, to the lamp room.":"v7_2bd59f90","Nine. Camera, your signal is wet. I am not going to ask.":"v7_87a7cce6","Nine. We saw a light come on near you. We have nothing on that level.":"v7_de672c72","Nine. Keep the tape running. That is the first light we have had on you.":"v7_5431e866","Hale. Nine says you are in the water. Find something to climb.":"v7_cfe67f3c","Power restored on Meridian. All hands to stations.":"v7_37ae72ce","Weather advisory. Secure all loose equipment.":"v7_5de7751a","Air supply restored to Habitat Two.":"v7_f05db371","Cape Sorrel light is operating.":"v7_5f3417bf","It's warmer further down.":"v7_a3962385","Leave the light. It's only light.":"v7_b6274261","Count the swells.":"v7_f95c2bb0","You could just let go of the ladder.":"v7_56ca5263","It knows the rig by its legs.":"v7_0cbd6321"};
